    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.5/p@129817",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "JOHN TALBOT.\nIs my name Talbot? And am I your son?\nAnd shall I fly? O, if you love my mother,\nDishonour not her honourable name,\nTo make a bastard and a slave of me!\nThe world will say, he is not Talbot’s blood,\nThat basely fled when noble Talbot stood.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
